;; days.edn: one map per Advent of Code day. Every page is generated from this file,
;; videos.edn, recipes.edn and ring.edn. Shape: docs/content-model.md.
;; Times are UTC. Unlock is 00:00 EST (05:00 UTC). Spoiler gate = unlock + 3 days (Jordan, 2026-11-27;
;; was 4 from 2026-11-24, 3 before that). No session may fall before its puzzle's gate (state_test).
;; Session formats are placeholders. A session's format, day covered, time and guests
;; render only once its :announced? is true; until then its row is pixel bars and a date
;; (Jordan, 2026-11-27). Guests are unconfirmed: keep :guests empty until someone agrees.
;; 12 days is assumed; Advent of Code hasn't published a count for 2026.
